{"encoding":"verislop.formalizer-capability-gap/0.1","obligation_ids":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6","O7","I1","S1"],"gaps":[{"obligation_ids":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6","O7","I1","S1"],"feature":"Wire-preserving string-literal enumeration or refinement sort for fill","reason":"D1 requires fill to have exactly the two string alternatives 'none' and 'previous'. The registered sorts provide unrestricted String but no literal enumeration or refinement. Consequently a typed solve endpoint preserving this exact input domain cannot be expressed, including the endpoint required by every source-facet guarantee. This report retains the missing-sort diagnostic without asserting impossibility or acceptance.","attempted_representations":["Declare fill as String and use equality tests in conditional expressions. This computes the two requested behaviors but admits additional strings in the declared input domain; branch guards do not refine the field's type.","Declare fill as String and include its two-value restriction in A1. Although the intended valid observations remain available, the declared D1 domain is still broadened; a predicate cannot supply the missing exact field sort.","Encode fill as Bool, Unit alternatives in Result, or an Option or record. These representations change the required string wire values or JSON structure; the grammar supplies no custom serialization mapping to restore them.","Use a custom enumeration in raw Lean. Raw Lean is subject to the same executable-DSL acceptance gates, and no registered enumeration sort or wire codec is supplied, so this does not provide an admitted faithful endpoint.","Use list_sort and list_unique for all event group names, list_range with int_to_nat of floor division of end-start+width-1 by width for bucket indices, occurrence-preserving event filters, and a per-group list_foldl carrying Option Int previous and ordered output records. These total operations can preserve clipping, duplicates, nulls, zero sums and causal filling, but their endpoint still requires the unsupported exact fill sort.","Attach all seven source requirements to the aggregation endpoint. SourceBoundary requirements constrain an existing typed endpoint; they cannot introduce the missing field sort or justify substituting a broader input domain."]}]}